{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-remote#card-zh","repo":"flymysql/dsh-remote","commit":"edf762c50536f2f4c9f8103a2c5be3e281a6dd85","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote 是面向 DSH 的 SSH 远程工作区插件，提供 Web、Desktop 与 TUI 使用入口。它把远程目录映射为本机镜像，并将会话绑定到对应主机和工作区。功能包括管理多台 SSH 主机、浏览及读写远端文件、在远端执行命令和搜索、双向冲突感知同步，以及端口转发和远端 DSH 网页附加。适合需要在 DSH 中维护远程开发环境、跨主机处理项目文件的开发者。需要可 SSH 登录的远程主机；默认使用内置 SSH，亦可选择本机 OpenSSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1930-2975","lib/client.js:3991-4015","lib/tui/index.js:117-250"]}
{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-remote#card-en","repo":"flymysql/dsh-remote","commit":"edf762c50536f2f4c9f8103a2c5be3e281a6dd85","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remote connects SSH hosts to DSH workspaces on Web, Desktop, and TUI. It manages machines, browses remote files, runs commands and searches, syncs conflict-aware local mirrors, forwards ports, and opens remote DSH web interfaces. It requires an SSH-accessible host.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1930-2975","lib/client.js:3991-4015","lib/tui/index.js:117-250"]}
