{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-remote#feature-1","repo":"flymysql/dsh-remote","commit":"edf762c50536f2f4c9f8103a2c5be3e281a6dd85","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote 的功能「SSH 主机连接」：保存并切换多台 SSH 主机，支持使用 ssh-config 主机别名、跳板机及不同认证方式；连接后可选择远程工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1983-2002","lib/index.js:2213-2242"]}
{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-remote#feature-2","repo":"flymysql/dsh-remote","commit":"edf762c50536f2f4c9f8103a2c5be3e281a6dd85","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote 的功能「远程工作区镜像」：验证远端目录后创建本地镜像，供 DSH 会话作为工作区使用；可通过同步工具拉取远端文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2213-2258","lib/index.js:2263-2290"]}
{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-remote#feature-3","repo":"flymysql/dsh-remote","commit":"edf762c50536f2f4c9f8103a2c5be3e281a6dd85","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote 的功能「远端文件管理」：通过 SFTP 列目录、查看属性、分页读取文件，并直接创建、追加、编辑、移动或删除远端文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2375-2710"]}
{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-remote#feature-4","repo":"flymysql/dsh-remote","commit":"edf762c50536f2f4c9f8103a2c5be3e281a6dd85","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote 的功能「远程命令执行」：在当前工作区或指定目录运行远端 shell 命令，可选择 PTY、设置超时，或返回后台任务编号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2707-2780"]}
{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-remote#feature-5","repo":"flymysql/dsh-remote","commit":"edf762c50536f2f4c9f8103a2c5be3e281a6dd85","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote 的功能「远端内容搜索」：按正则搜索远端文件，支持文件名 glob、大小写选项和上下文行；扫描受文件数与时长限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2783-2848","lib/search.js:64-160"]}
