{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-remote#feature-7","repo":"flymysql/dsh-remote","commit":"edf762c50536f2f4c9f8103a2c5be3e281a6dd85","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote 的功能「SSH 端口转发」：创建本地或反向转发定义，并通过 SSH 隧道连接目标主机和端口；设置可在连接时恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2913-2952","lib/forwards.js:97-139"]}
